~ start
Shopkeeper: Welcome, adventurer!
Shopkeeper: I have gear if you have enough gold.
Shopkeeper: Do you want to see my goods?

- Yes => open_shop
- No => leave


~ open_shop
do GameState.choice = "yes"
Shopkeeper: Very well, take a look at what I sell!
=> END


~ leave
do GameState.choice = "no"
Shopkeeper: Too bad... come back when you are ready.
=> END
